  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Toshi goes straight to Furuya to call off their underground deal, only for Furuya to hand over the hideout operation, demand Kuroki's master tape, and remind Toshi that he is already an accomplice. Listen for \"hikikaesu\", to turn back.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "実は相談があって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "俺もちょうどお前に話あんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ここ丸ごとお前に譲りたいんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "えっ？いや、それは…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "信用できるヤツはお前しかいないんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "いや、古谷さん、でも…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "受け取ってくれよ。よかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "それと黒木の作品、持ってきてくれねえか。裏で流すから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "いや、ちょっとそれは…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "どうした？引き返したくなったのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "無理だぞ。藤原はもう死んじまったからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "だろ？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "実は相談があって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Actually, I came to talk to you about something.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "俺もちょうどお前に話あんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just happened to have something to tell you too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ここ丸ごとお前に譲りたいんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to hand this whole operation over to you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "えっ？いや、それは…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What? Wait, hold on...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "信用できるヤツはお前しかいないんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are the only man left whom I can trust.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "いや、古谷さん、でも…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, Mr. Furuya, I can't...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "受け取ってくれよ。よかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take it off my hands, okay? Good.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "それと黒木の作品、持ってきてくれねえか。裏で流すから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Also, bring me Kuroki's master tape so we can sell it underground.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "いや、ちょっとそれは…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, hold on, I cannot do that...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "どうした？引き返したくなったのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is wrong? Getting cold feet and wanting to turn back?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "無理だぞ。藤原はもう死んじまったからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Too late for that. Fujiwara is already dead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "だろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Isn't that right?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
